  "content_html": "<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p><strong>Shimmer Body Spray Golden Glow is your secret to a luxurious golden radiance every single day!</strong></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://uniksshop.com/content/uploads/images/sprey-09.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p>Infuse your skin with a warm shimmer and a sophisticated fragrance. This shimmer body spray combines nourishing care with a delicate decorative effect, leaving your skin without any stickiness or greasy shine.<br/>\n<strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://uniksshop.com/content/uploads/images/sprey-08.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></strong></p>\n<p><strong>What makes it special:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Gold glitters:</strong> Food-grade shimmering particles create a soft glow that beautifully reflects the light and enhances your skin's natural beauty.</li>\n<li><strong>Natural oils:</strong> Enriched with argan oil, the formula deeply nourishes and hydrates, boosting skin firmness and elasticity.</li>\n<li><strong>Shea butter:</strong> Effectively softens the skin, delivering an ultimate sensation of comfort.</li>\n<li><strong>Weightless texture: </strong>The spray applies effortlessly, absorbs quickly, and leaves no sticky residue.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://uniksshop.com/content/uploads/images/sprey-02.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p>Perfect for evening events, photoshoots, special occasions, or whenever you want to infuse a touch of \"wow-effect\" into your everyday life.<br/>\n<strong>Volume:</strong> 155 ml — the perfect size for daily use, delivering a long-lasting fragrance and an enduring glow.</p>\n </div>\n</div>",
