.space/oplata-i-dostavka/\">More about delivery</a></p>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"payment-2\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p>Payment to the current account:</p>\n<p>Beneficiary: [PAYMENT DETAILS OMITTED] Mariia Borysivna</p>\n<p>IBAN: [PAYMENT DETAILS OMITTED]</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Online payment via Plata by mono</p>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"guarantee-2\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p>12-month manufacturer's warranty.</p>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__column-item\">\n<div class=\"product__group product__group--tabs\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<nav class=\"product-heading__nav\" id=\"nav-6af745d92abbc\">\n<a class=\"product-heading__tab\" href=\"#description-3\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title\">Description</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"product-heading__tab\" href=\"#reviews-3\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title\"><div id=\"comments\">\n            A new review or comment    </div>\n</div>\n</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"description-3\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p><strong>Shimmer Body Spray Golden Glow is your secret to a luxurious golden radiance every single day!</strong></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://uniksshop.com/content/uploads/images/sprey-09.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p>Infuse your skin with a warm shimmer and a sophisticated fragrance. This shimmer body spray combines nourishing care with a delicate decorative effect, leaving your skin without any stickiness or greasy shine.<br/>\n<strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://uniksshop.com/content/uploads/images/sprey-08.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></strong></p>\n<p><strong>What makes it special:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Gold glitters:</strong> Food-grade shimmering particles create a soft glow that beautifully reflects the light and enhances your skin's natural beauty.</li>\n<li><strong>Natural oils:</strong> Enriched with argan oil, the formula deeply nourishes and hydrates, boosting skin firmness and elasticity.</li>\n<li><strong>Shea butter:</strong> Effectively softens the skin, delivering an ultimate sensation of comfort.</li>\n<li><strong>Weightless texture: </strong>The spray applies effortlessly, absorbs quickly, and leaves no sticky residue.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://uniksshop.com/content/uploads/images/sprey-02.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p>Perfect for evening events, photoshoots, special occasions, or whenever you want to infuse a touch of \"wow-effect\" into your everyday life.<br/>\n<strong>Volume:</strong> 155 ml — the perfect size for daily use, delivering a long-lasting fragrance and an enduring glow.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"reviews-3\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<section class=\"product-reviews\">\n<div class=\"reviews\" id=\"comments-container-uid25ce2b1e5924b627dcb7194a15c29af7\">\n<div class=\"reviews__inner\">\n<div class=\"p-review\" id=\"uid25ce2b1e5924b627dcb7194a15c29af7\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"reviews__add-comment\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom\">\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"5927c15eb3681925593ba54894f82d36\" style=\"positio